  "name": "Opening of the New Tempering Workshop!",
  "sourceUrl": "https://honkai-star-rail.fandom.com/wiki/Opening_of_the_New_Tempering_Workshop!",
  "scrapedAt": "2026-07-11T05:51:38.089Z",
  "volumes": [
    {
      "id": "1",
      "label": "Text",
      "document": {
        "version": 1,
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": []
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Dear fellow vagrants, good day!"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "I am Oggla Clark of Rivet Town."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "You may not have heard of me, but you probably have heard of the Tempering Workshop in Rivet Town."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "That's right! I hail from this legendary workshop!"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Rivet Town has completely fallen to the invasion of Fragmentum Monsters, and the old Tempering Workshop has disbanded because of that."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Even as I arrive at this vagrant camp, I am unable to locate my former colleagues."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "However, there are a number of able craftspeople among the vagrant community, and we have hit it off right away."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Therefore, I have decided to inherit the name of the beloved Tempering Workshop by founding the"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "New Tempering Workshop!"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Services provided:"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Appraisal, repairing, and recycling of various ancient relics"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Recycling and refurbishment of old parts"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Sale of various spare parts"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "We hope all fellow vagrants pay attention to the fact that the supply of goods in the workshop does not come from conventional channels."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "All of the parts we have are sourced from putting in hard work and risking our lives in the machine graveyard."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Each and every one of them has a soul and is infused with our heart and persistence!"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Even though some may complain about the appearance and variety of our wares,"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "You will be hard-pressed to find another establishment like ours!"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "So what are you waiting for?"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Take action rather than take fancy!"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Come to the New Tempering Workshop and look for the gadgets of your dreams!"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Come with your robot friend and enjoy a 50% discount!"
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  ]
}
